TheCostOfAWideRuleTest
├── when the demo rule opens at every place
│   └── it should open for less than the demo budget
├── when the demo rule cancels at every place
│   └── it should cancel for less than the demo budget
├── when the demo rule is spent
│   └── it should hand over for less than the demo budget
├── when a wide rule opens at every place
│   └── it should open for less than the wide budget
├── when a wide rule cancels at every place
│   └── it should cancel for less than the wide budget
└── when a wide rule is spent
    └── it should hand over for less than the demo budget
